[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12180.83, "timestamp": "03:23:00", "text": "我认为阿斯特拉是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12183.67, "timestamp": "03:23:03", "text": "等等，Astra 使用的是哪种方法？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12185.95, "timestamp": "03:23:05", "text": "我忘了。我认为他正在做本地的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12194.469, "timestamp": "03:23:14", "text": "本地方法就像你使用你呃使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12197.91, "timestamp": "03:23:17", "text": "让你的 OBS 像直播一样在 YouTube 上直播"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12199.735, "timestamp": "03:23:19", "author": "@saii.", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/3zUIW6dAQ6Lr5vLl0lqQ1SDX6_FlSHF5uPT02PbCpi3rR1u3H4KK3Clvc3h4GwayKUCSUkNFr_Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "oh no, my astra😢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12201.269, "timestamp": "03:23:21", "text": "还有 Twitch。所以像往常一样使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12203.429, "timestamp": "03:23:23", "text": "添加 YouTube 并点赞直播。按下开始键"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12206.79, "timestamp": "03:23:26", "text": "活着，对吧？一样。是的，你有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12211.19, "timestamp": "03:23:31", "text": "呃，把它设置好，呃，随便什么都行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12214.55, "timestamp": "03:23:34", "text": "你赋予GPU的电力资源"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12217.67, "timestamp": "03:23:37", "text": "通过 OBS 从你的电脑上观看 YouTube 视频"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12221.269, "timestamp": "03:23:41", "text": "对 Twitch 也采取同样的做法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12224.469, "timestamp": "03:23:44", "text": "所以它的功率是原来的两倍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12228.79, "timestamp": "03:23:48", "text": "那种东西。例如，比如说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12230.87, "timestamp": "03:23:50", "text": "向 YouTube 直播只需几秒钟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12237.03, "timestamp": "03:23:57", "text": "这CPU使用率居然高达20%，对吧？所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12239.349, "timestamp": "03:23:59", "text": "呃，如果再加上 Twitch 就更好了，"}]